# Edemint notifications (mako) — glass surface from docs/PALETTE.md
# (floating tint at 0.84 alpha: legible without blur; the full effects
# profile blurs behind it). Flat fills, rounded rectangles, no animations.
# Critical notifications go fully opaque — emphasis goes solid, and state is
# never communicated by color alone.
font=Noto Sans 11
background-color=#171E54D6
text-color=#FFFFFF
border-color=#74FBEA
border-size=2
border-radius=16
padding=12
margin=12
default-timeout=8000
max-icon-size=32

[urgency=critical]
background-color=#750303
text-color=#FFFFFF
border-color=#E31515
default-timeout=0
